B.azB=new A.eE("Young's Double Slit Experiment","As a personal endeavor, I leveraged the probabilistic nature of qubits to simulate **Young\u2019s Double-Slit Experiment** using **Qiskit**. This project explored quantum **superposition and interference** principles, demonstrating how quantum computing can model classical **wave-particle duality**. The implementation utilized **quantum circuits** to mimic photon behavior","Python , Qiskit, Qiskit-AER","Personal Endeavor","https://github.com/Risav25Pokhrel/Young-s-Double-Slit-Experiment")
